,"kind":"person","person_id":"aot_lni_dfq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032:m0141","start":141,"end":142,"surface":"遷","kind":"person","person_id":"aot_lni_dfq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p002:m0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"馮遷","kind":"person","person_id":"aot_lni_dfq","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi"},{"id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p003:m0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"馮遷","kind":"person","person_id":"aot_lni_dfq","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p003","chapter_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi-3-187","title":"漢嘉太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"aot_lni_dfq","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi-3-187:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p003","start":187,"end":191,"surface":"漢嘉太守","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p003:m0191","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-048","chapter_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi-ws1791560","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p003","quote":"晉安帝反正於江陵，除驍騎將軍。下至京師，高祖以為鎮軍諮議參軍，加寧朔將軍。旬月，遷右衞將軍。既有斬玄之謀，又伯、父並在蜀土，高祖欲引為外助，故頻加榮爵。及父瑾為譙縱所殺，高祖表為龍驤將軍，配給兵力，遣令奔赴。又遣益州刺史司馬榮期及文處茂、時延祖等西討。脩之至宕渠，榮期為參軍楊承祖所殺，承祖自稱鎮軍將軍、巴州刺史。脩之退還白帝，承祖自下攻之，不拔。脩之使參軍嚴綱等收合兵眾，漢嘉太守馮遷率兵來會，討承祖斬之。時文處茂猶在巴郡，脩之遣振武將軍張季仁五百兵係處茂等。荊州刺史道規又遣奮武將軍原導之領千人，受脩之節度。脩之遣原導之與季仁俱進。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-maoxiuzhi:p003:m0191"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032","text":"時益州刺史毛璩使其從孫祐之、參軍費恬送弟璠喪葬江陵，有眾二百，璩弟子脩之為玄屯騎校尉，誘玄以入蜀，玄從之。達枚回洲，恬與祐之迎擊玄，矢下如雨。玄嬖人丁仙期、萬蓋等以身敝玄，並中數十箭而死。玄被箭，其子升輒拔去之。益州督護馮遷抽刀而前，玄拔頭上玉導與之，仍曰：「是何人邪？敢殺天子！」遷曰：「欲殺天子之賊耳。」遂斬之，時年三十六。又斬石康及浚等五級，庾頤之戰死。升云：「我是豫章王，諸君勿見殺。」送至江陵市斬之。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2644703-raw.wikitext","raw_start":9210,"raw_end":9417,"character_positions":[9212,9213,9214,9215,9216,9217,9218,9219,9220,9221,9222,9223,9224,9225,9226,9227,9228,9229,9230,9231,9232,9233,9234,9235,9236,9237,9238,9239,9240,9241,9242,9243,9244,9245,9246,9247,9248,9249,9250,9251,9252,9253,9254,9255,9256,9257,9258,9259,9260,9261,9262,9263,9264,9265,9266,9267,9268,9269,9270,9271,9272,9273,9274,9275,9276,9277,9278,9279,9280,9281,9282,9283,9284,9285,9286,9287,9288,9289,9290,9291,9292,9293,9294,9295,9296,9297,9298,9299,9300,9301,9302,9303,9304,9305,9306,9307,9308,9309,9310,9311,9312,9313,9314,9315,9316,9317,9318,9319,9320,9321,9322,9323,9324,9325,9326,9327,9328,9329,9330,9331,9332,9333,9334,9335,9336,9337,9338,9339,9340,9341,9342,9343,9344,9345,9346,9347,9348,9349,9350,9351,9352,9353,9354,9355,9356,9357,9358,9359,9360,9361,9362,9363,9364,9365,9366,9367,9368,9369,9370,9371,9372,9373,9374,9375,9376,9377,9378,9379,9380,9381,9382,9383,9384,9385,9386,9387,9388,9389,9390,9391,9392,9393,9394,9395,9396,9397,9398,9399,9400,9401,9402,9403,9404,9405,9406,9407,9408,9409,9410,9411,9412,9413,9414,9415,9416]},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"毛璩","kind":"person","person_id":"m7n_39i_5bk","status":"contextual_provisional"